1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
I want to mend every crack.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
I sealed the final gap.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Why has the world gone quiet?

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
You heard the waiting wind.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Even a gap has a purpose.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
A repair can leave room.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Leave a door for the wind.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
A little room brings sound.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
The world breathes again.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Listen before you mend.
